    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Cartesian product</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/letter-combinations-of-a-phone-number/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 17</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Letter Combinations of a Phone Number</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">One digit = one level of a tree, one letter = one branch. A DFS that appends a letter, recurses, and pops it back visits every root-to-leaf path once, and each leaf is one word. O(4<sup>n</sup> · n) time, which is the size of the output; O(n) extra space.</p>\n"
